        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5059SPK, Spoke Knobset with Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Spoke Knob with Disk Rose is a brand new design from Emtek--one that shows how cool modern design in door hardware can really be. This Spoke Knobset with Disk Rosette is sure to catch eyes. It looks custom but since it's made by Emtek, you can be sure that it is easy to install. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions in any of Emtek's modern finish colors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-SPK-specifcation.gif?v=1704354535\" width=\"461\" height=\"242\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Spoke Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Studio Brass Spoke Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Spoke Knob and Round Disk Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-SPK-specification.pdf?v=1704262417\"><b>Emtek Spoke Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Spoke Knob with Disk Rose",
                "description": "The Spoke Knob with Disk Rose is a brand new design from Emtek--one that shows how cool modern design in door hardware can really be. This Spoke Knobset with Disk Rosette is sure to catch eyes. It looks custom but since it's made by Emtek, you can be sure that it is easy to install. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions in any of Emtek's modern finish colors.",
